<template><div><section><h2 id="details-setup">Key Features: stage and teleporter</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-setup-1" data-guide-step>Open a route from the lobby to the stage and switch on power. Link the teleporter at the stage and then the mainframe in the lobby.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-2" data-guide-step>Use the linked teleporter for the Pack-a-Punch room. Watch the return timing and finish purchases before being moved onward.</li>
<li id="guide-step-setup-3" data-guide-step>Collect film reels from the intermission rooms and use the projector when available.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-secrets">Meteorites and Samantha knocks</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-secrets-1" data-guide-step>Interact with the three meteorite fragments to activate the music secret.</li>
<li id="guide-step-secrets-2" data-guide-step>For the Chronicles Samantha sequence, listen to the three groups of knocks and record each count. Repeat the observed pattern at the interaction point.</li>
